# Conformance run artifacts land here, one directory per run.
#
# Directory name is the run id from conformance/scenarios.yaml:
#   <scenario-id>.<harness-id>.<YYYY-MM-DD>.<counter>
#
# The directory is empty because no scenario has been run. A run directory is
# never edited after its digests are recorded; a correction is a new run whose
# run.yaml names the run it supersedes.
